  "details": "Dragging the menu downward and then using the scroll wheel causes the menu to jump around a bit til the momentum of the drag stops.\nIt would be nice to have the scroll wheel cancel out the menus momentum so it feels snappier to use on desktop. For example, most web browsers with touchscreen support cancel out flick scrolling when the mouse wheel is used.\n(same with the page up/down buttons if those are added)\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1137-page-up-page-down-buttons-dont-appear-to-do-anything-in-friends-wing-menu\nVideo Clip:\nhttps://youtu.be/s6GkqeQvOuc",
